# Tam, the Possibility counts planeswalker types among planeswalkers you control, and only those (CR 205.3j, 306.3).
# The Aetherspark is a planeswalker whose subtype is Equipment, an artifact type, not a planeswalker type; Wrenn and Six
# is a Wrenn. X is one, so the ability asks once, and the refusal after the one answer holds (a second question would
# be asked if Equipment counted). Wrenn and Six's three loyalty counters become four; The Aetherspark's four stay.
# Tam's reduction paid The Aetherspark's {4} with three Moxen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Tam, the Possibility
Wrenn and Six
The Aetherspark
Island x11

